io/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QVonMangoldtFunction.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Decidability of the defect predicate (so the piecewise value is a term). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.isFundamentalDefect","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.isFundamentalDefect","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QVonMangoldtFunction.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Whether `𝔪` is a fundamental defect (lies over a prime of the centre). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.hbar_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.hbar_q","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QVonMangoldtFunction.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Substrate `q`-Planck constant `ℏ_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.N","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QVonMangoldtFunction.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Norm `N(𝔪)` — the residue-field cardinality. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.Idx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.Idx","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QVonMangoldtFunction.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Index type for the maximal ideals `𝔪` of `𝒪_q(𝓑)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QVonMangoldtFunction.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.QVonMangoldtFunction","kind":"structure","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/QVonMangoldtFunction.lean#L17-L40","doc":"Data for the q-von Mangoldt function `Λ_q`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: `Idx` indexes the maximal ideals `𝔪`, `N 𝔪` is\nthe norm (residue-field cardinality), `isFundamentalDefect` marks the\nideals lying over a prime of the centre, and `Lambda_q` is pinned by its\ndefining piecewise value — the `q`-deformation `(N 𝔪 ^ ℏ_q − 1)/ℏ_q` of\n`log N(𝔪)` on defects, `0` otherwise. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-von-mangoldt-function","label":"def:q-von-mangoldt-function","md":"quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/q-von-mangoldt-function.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}